                                "sense_id": "749cf27b-bbf1-38ea-932a-83f40b90650f",
                                "text": "As for those Samnites, and the men of Uz,\nThat bought my Spanish oils and wines of Greece,\nHere have I purs'd their paltry silverlings.\nFie, what a trouble 'tis to count this trash!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0f5db7d-346f-456a-a418-f36410d348f9",
                                "sense_id": "749cf27b-bbf1-38ea-932a-83f40b90650f",
                                "text": "And it shall come to pass in that day, that every place shall be, where there were a thousand vines at a thousand silverlings, it shall even be for briers and thorns."
                            }
                        ]
